This component is a number detector. It is active on digit tokens (0-9) and on
number words, and most strongly on a digit that starts or continues a quantity in
running prose: after a decimal point, a currency sign, an equals sign, a sign, or a
word such as "of", "about", "is", "at", "by" ("a rate of 85", "about 8 mm",
